 "wholeClubs": "Beyond the sixty, every man the game carries for these six clubs (407) was compared with ESPN's whole page. 391 agreed on club and list (7 of them starters the game carries off a reserve list, whom ESPN has on injured reserve, as the starters rule expects). The other 16: 6 are one man under two spellings (JuJu and Julius Brents, Olu and Olumuyiwa Fashanu, Kiko and Francisco Mauigoa, Josh and Joshua Uche, Robert and Rob Beal Jr., Cameron and Cam Robertson); 9 are practice squad men ESPN prints on the active list (Nick Mullens, Jalen McLeod, Max Llewellyn, Liam Anderson, Will Levis, Sterling Shepard, Julian Good-Jones, Ricky Barber, Ale Kaho), every one of them on the practice squad on his club's own page; and 1 is a real move after the reading: Matt Pryor, an ARI practice squad tackle in the week 4 release, is on neither ARI page on 2026-10-01, so the game has him where the club had him on the day the release was read. ESPN also carries men the release does not: four on injured reserve (Xavier Weaver, Josh Minkins, Devon Marshall, Caullin Lacy), who would not be in the game anyway, and one practice squad man, Jimto Obidegwu, whom the release lists as cut and the Jaguars' own page does not carry.",
